        "tab_color": "#ffffff",
        "margin_top": 68,
        "margin_bottom": 68,
        "title": "The Science of HempLucid",
        "max_width": 73,
        "content": "<p>We do not ask you to take our word for it. Every ingredient in our products exists because peer-reviewed research indicates it has a meaningful role in human physiology. That standard applies across our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/full-spectrum-whole-plant-cbd\" target=\"_blank\">full spectrum hemp research-backed products</a>, where whole-plant extraction preserves the minor cannabinoids and terpenes that appear alongside CBD in the published literature. This page is our commitment to showing you that evidence—clearly, honestly, and without exaggeration. Cannabinoid science is advancing rapidly, but it is not yet complete. Some findings are biologically established across decades of study. Others are emerging from early-stage clinical trials. We believe you deserve to know exactly where the evidence stands—so you can make decisions based on data, not marketing.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/science-of-hemplucid.png",
        "image_position": "left"
      }
    },
    "wl_tabbed_image_and_text_EzzGVE": {
      "type": "wl-tabbed-image-and-text",
      "name": "HL Tabbed Image & Text",
      "settings": {
        "cclasses": "",
        "color": "#ffffff",
        "font_color": "#241f21",
        "link_color": "#C83D1B",
        "show_tab": true,
        "tab_color": "#eae1d5",
        "margin_top": 68,
        "margin_bottom": 68,
        "title": "Our Research Philosophy",
        "max_width": 73,
        "content": "<p>Hemplucid is not a pharmaceutical company. We do not conduct our own clinical trials or claim that our products treat, cure, or prevent disease. What we do is build our formulations on the foundation of published, peer-reviewed science—and point you directly to the sources.</p><p>That principle extends to delivery format as well: the serving sizes in a Hemplucid <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/cbd-tinctures\" target=\"_blank\">CBD oil tincture</a> reflect what the literature supports, and our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/cbd-mct-oil\" target=\"_blank\">hemp CBD MCT oil</a> pairs cannabinoids with a lipid carrier chosen for the same reason.<br/><br/>Every external study linked on this page opens in a new tab so you can read the original research for yourself. We cite specific sample sizes, study designs, and limitations because precision builds trust. If a study is small or preclinical, we say so.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/research-philosophy.png",
        "image_position": "right"
      }
    },
