            "header_color": "#595378",
            "header_font_color": "#ffffff",
            "body_color": "#fcf5ed",
            "content": "<p>Studied in human clinical trials (randomized, placebo-controlled) with published results, but not yet sufficient for regulatory approval or broad medical consensus. Example: CBD’s observed effects on cortisol and subjective stress markers.</p>"
